Full per-file change-history record (all columns): re-run with `--format csv` or `--format json`.

## Bus factor

_Bus factor: the number of authors whose departure would orphan more than half the files; lower is riskier._

**Repository:** 2 (over 3 files, coverage threshold 0.50).

| Directory | Bus factor | Files |
| --------- | ---------: | ----: |
| docs      |          1 |     1 |
| src       |          2 |     2 |

## Legend

- **Risk** — Composite change-history risk score: recent churn and commit frequency dominate, raised by author dilution, bug-/security-fix history, and newness. Ordinal: only relative ranks carry meaning, not the absolute value.
- **Commits (recent)** — Distinct commits that touched this file in the recent window (default 90 days, set via --recent-window). Wire key: commits_recent.
- **Churn (recent)** — Lines added + deleted to this file in the recent window (default 90 days, set via --recent-window). Wire key: churn_recent.
- **Authors (recent)** — Distinct authors who touched this file in the recent window (default 90 days, set via --recent-window). Wire key: authors_recent.
- **Ownership** — Top-author edit share (0–1): fraction of edits by the single most active author; lower means more diluted ownership.
- **Bug fixes** — Commits classified as bug fixes (by message) within the long window.
- **Hotspot** — Complexity × recent churn: high-complexity files that also change often. Shown only when AST metrics are joined (e.g. report --vcs); omitted by plain bca vcs.
- **Bus factor** — Number of authors whose departure would orphan more than half the files (by Avelino Degree-of-Authorship); lower is riskier.
- **Files** — Files in this directory contributing to its bus factor.
